{"version":1,"content":"\n<figure><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"538\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://hkcourtnews.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/20261014_hkcourtnews_Tak_Long_Estate_murder-1024x538.jpg\" width=\"1024\"/></figure>\n<p><strong>一名居於啟德德朗邨的九旬婦日前死亡，52歲印傭被控一項謀殺罪，今（13日）在觀塘裁判法院首度提堂。被告暫毋須答辯，案件押後明年1月6日再訊，以待進一步調查，被告無保釋申請，須還柙候訊。</strong></p>\n<p>\n<p><a href=\"https://linktr.ee/hkcourtnews\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">訂閱《庭刊》</a></p>\n</p>\n<p>印尼籍被告Kharsina（52歲，報稱為家傭），被控於2026年10月11日，在牛頭角德朗邨德耀樓一單位謀殺事主。</p>\n<p>法院：觀塘裁判法院<br/>被告：Kharsina<br/>控罪：謀殺<br/>案件編號：KTCC2053/2026</p>\n<figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://qr.payme.hsbc.com.hk/2/QrndvPxDgEi2MhNiNPz4b8\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"916\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://hkcourtnews.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/05/%E5%BA%AD%E5%88%8A%EF%BD%9CHKCourtNews_PayMe_QR_code.png\" width=\"716\"/></a></figure>\n<figure><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"1080\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://hkcourtnews.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/05/hkcourtnews_Octopus_QRcode_Payment_v4.png\" width=\"1080\"/></figure>\n</figure>\n<p><strong>如欲接收每日報道整合，請在訊息欄內填寫電郵地址</strong></p>\n","scraped_at":"2026-10-15T07:47:39.444198+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":229,"images":3,"source":"法庭線","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"wordpress-public-posts","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-14T11:33:56+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-15T07:40:37.416994+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-15T07:40:37.416994+00:00","content_hash":"4f06b3f149b7129b7dab789a1d86ca134d8ed5b45cdd5e41a8da0951fa912012","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}